---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
import { EMAIL, PHONE_DISPLAY, PHONE_E164 } from "../data/business";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | ROH Tiling Wellington"
  description="Discuss the scope, preparation, materials, responsibilities and written quote for your ROH Tiling job before work is agreed."
  canonical="/terms"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Terms of Service" }]}
>
  <PageHeader
    title="Terms of Service"
    subtitle="Agree the details of your tiling job in writing before work starts."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal">
      <p class="legal__lead">
        This website introduces ROH Tiling and its work. The scope and terms for
        your particular job need to be confirmed with Roh in a written quote.
      </p>
      <h2>Your quote and scope</h2>
      <p>
        Discuss the surfaces to be tiled, preparation, tile choice, layout,
        access and the work of other trades. Ask what is included, what is
        excluded and what may need further inspection. Confirm the price,
        timing, quote validity, payment terms and any changes in writing.
      </p>
      <h2>Materials and existing surfaces</h2>
      <p>
        Tell Roh about known damage, leaks, movement or earlier repairs.
        Removing an old finish may reveal conditions that were not visible when
        you first enquired. Discuss how any additional work would be assessed
        and agreed.
      </p>
      <h2>Wet areas and other trades</h2>
      <p>
        For a shower or other wet area, confirm the waterproofing system, who is
        carrying out the work and the documentation required for the project.
        Electrical and plumbing work need the appropriate trades. Ask who is
        arranging each part before booking.
      </p>
      <h2>Workmanship and aftercare</h2>
      <p>
        Ask Roh to confirm any applicable workmanship warranty, product warranty
        and aftercare instructions for your job. This page does not set a
        warranty duration or promise a particular compliance document. Nothing
        here limits your rights under applicable New Zealand consumer law.
      </p>
      <h2>Photographs and enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        Project photographs show past work. Work-in-progress photographs are
        labelled; they do not establish the condition of hidden layers. A
        website enquiry starts a conversation and does not book work. See the{" "}
        <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for how enquiry details and
        optional photographs are handled.
      </p>
      <address class="legal__contact">
        Questions about your quote? Call{" "}
        <a href={`tel:${PHONE_E164}`}>{PHONE_DISPLAY}</a> or email{" "}
        <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>.
      </address>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
